  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 COD - Settlement Names v2.0",
    "description": "The dataset consists of settlement points with name and attributes for eleven provinces in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (COD). Province group 1: Haut-Katanga, Kasaï, Kasaï-Oriental, Kinshasa, and Lomami Province group 2: Haut-Lomami and Tanganyika Province group 3: Ituri and Kwilu Province group 4: Maniema Province group 5: Kasaï-Central This operational dataset has not been fully validated by government officials or ministries. The current version supersedes GRID3 COD - Settlement Names v1.0 (https://doi.org/10.7916/20k1-2a73). This current version includes the province of Kasaï-Central. Keywords: settlements",
    "license": "The data and accompanying document are licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International, CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0) and specified in legal code (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode)",
